        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we fuel approximately 16,200 refuse vehicles for customers including Waste Management, Republic Services, Waste Connections, GFL Environmental, Atlas Disposal, Burrtec, CR&R, Recology and Waste Pro, among others.",
        "start_character": 46310,
        "end_character": 46547
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide vehicle fueling services to municipal refuse fleets.",
        "start_character": 46548,
        "end_character": 46616
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also committed to contributing to quality of life improvement and economic development in the communities where we conduct business, many of which are disadvantaged communities that suffer from poor air quality due to the use of transportation fuels, including diesel, that have high GHG emissions and significantly negative air quality impacts.",
        "start_character": 15973,
        "end_character": 16325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we sell LNG for non-vehicle purposes, including to customers who use LNG in rocket propulsion and oil fields, and for utility, industrial, marine and rail applications.",
        "start_character": 11390,
        "end_character": 11572
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a comprehensive clean energy solutions provider, we also design and build, as well as operate and maintain (“O&M”), public and private vehicle fueling stations in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 2643,
        "end_character": 2817
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we deliver RNG to the transportation market through 582 fueling stations we own, operate or supply in 43 states and the District of Columbia in the U.S., including over 200 stations in California.",
        "start_character": 5543,
        "end_character": 5764
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we operate four CNG fueling stations as part of the Tourmaline JDA in Edmonton, Calgary, Grande Prairie, Alberta and Kamloops, British Columbia.",
        "start_character": 28875,
        "end_character": 29044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on the foregoing, we believe that we are presented with nearly every material development, supply and distribution opportunity in the market.",
        "start_character": 36971,
        "end_character": 37118
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Further, we enter long-term RNG supply offtake agreements with well-known third parties that own RNG production facilities.",
        "start_character": 4495,
        "end_character": 4618
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Generally, the number of Environmental Credits we generate increases as we sell higher volumes of RNG as a vehicle fuel.",
        "start_character": 11846,
        "end_character": 11966
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we transport and sell CNG through NG Advantage’s virtual natural gas pipelines and interconnects and compete with other participants in this market.",
        "start_character": 49615,
        "end_character": 49776
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019215",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019215-9f5874774e5e5c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019215",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Environmental Credits that we sell are composed of RINs and state low-carbon fuel credits, including LCFS credits, which are generated from the conversion of biogas to RNG that is used as a transportation fuel.",
